    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d43-a1">

                <pb facs="0112" n="52" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg52"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 326.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Grant to Mr. Thompson</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santa Catharina</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-12-18"><hi rendition="#italic">December 18,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Three seamen of American schooner <hi rendition="#italic">Isaiah K. Stetson</hi>
                    badly wounded Sunday night by soldiers; one died last night. Protested to-day;
                    soldiers were recognized; affair in hands of police. Particulars by mail.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grant</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >U. S. Consular Agent</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
